  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity with Disabled People&apos;s Organisations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the capacity of disabled people&apos;s organisations in Tanzania to be an effective, vibrant and democratic membership movement that can be sustainable and plan, fundraise, implement and report on, their own activities

To support and train disabled people&apos;s organisations so that they can: bring about lasting social and policy change through advocacy for comprehensive disability legislation; and lobby for inclusion in mainstream development programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
